                                                "sense_id": "6c94dbd5-64cb-3a5d-816d-cc10999a471c",
                                                "text": "No wonder Miss Howard had suggested “hushing it up.” Now I understood that unfinished sentence of hers: “Emily herself——” And in my heart I agreed with her. Would not Mrs. Inglethorp have preferred to go unavenged rather than have such terrible dishonour fall upon the name of Cavendish."
